# =============================================================================
# CASE MAPPINGS
# =============================================================================
#
# IPA Extensions are primarily lowercase phonetic symbols without case pairs.
# Capital forms for some letters exist in Latin Extended-B (U+0180-U+024F).
# Cross-block case mappings should be defined in a combined/merged file that
# includes both blocks, as LSDL files are self-contained.
#
# =============================================================================

# No intra-block case mappings (all IPA Extensions are lowercase)

